# 💥 **Exemple complet — Shell avec TabBar**

## 🗺️ **Vue globale**

* Onglet **Accueil** → HomePage
* Onglet **Profil** → ProfilePage
* Onglet **Paramètres** → SettingsPage

---

## 🟢 **1️⃣ HomePage.xaml**

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             x:Class="MauiApp1.HomePage"
             Title="Accueil">

    <StackLayout Padding="20">
        <Label Text="Bienvenue sur Accueil" FontSize="22" HorizontalOptions="Center"/>
    </StackLayout>
</ContentPage>
```

---

### ✅ HomePage.xaml.cs

```csharp
namespace MauiApp1
{
    public partial class HomePage : ContentPage
    {
        public HomePage()
        {
            InitializeComponent();
        }
    }
}
```

---

